WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,480
I just managed to squeeze it out a little bit.

2
00:00:02,090 --> 00:00:03,530
There are several hundred people in our team

3
00:00:03,810 --> 00:00:05,050
How much food do you need to eat in a day?

4
00:00:05,490 --> 00:00:07,370
Even if I use all the connections I can use

5
00:00:07,450 --> 00:00:08,610
Get a few hundred pounds at a time

6
00:00:08,810 --> 00:00:10,730
Even if each family is divided, they won’t be able to survive for long.

7
00:00:11,210 --> 00:00:13,370
It helps for a while, but it can't help for a while

8
00:00:15,050 --> 00:00:16,130
What else can we do?

9
00:00:17,810 --> 00:00:19,770
We really want the people to starve.

10
00:00:21,220 --> 00:00:22,460
It's not completely impossible

11
00:00:23,340 --> 00:00:25,180
But the brigade itself must take action first

12
00:00:25,500 --> 00:00:30,950
We can’t rely entirely on you, A Tian, to be number one.

13
00:00:31,270 --> 00:00:33,270
Don’t rush to completely dismantle the collective canteen yet.

14
00:00:33,670 --> 00:00:35,910
First gather the food that can be distributed uniformly in the team

15
00:00:36,070 --> 00:00:37,030
Save food per head

16
00:00:37,230 --> 00:00:41,310
Don't let the people who are most in need be cut off first, and then immediately organize laborers who can go up the mountain.

17
00:00:41,430 --> 00:00:44,470
Digging wild vegetables, looking for mountain products and replenishing fish can make up for one thing and the third.

18
00:00:44,990 --> 00:00:46,870
I will send someone to the commune today and then to the county.

19
00:00:47,150 --> 00:00:48,990
Embrace the true situation of our team now

20
00:00:49,270 --> 00:00:55,630
Even if we can get some relief grain and anti-market grain, we can survive for a few more days. We will go there in a while.

21
00:00:56,310 --> 00:00:58,190
Each household also has to adjust to each other

22
00:00:58,750 --> 00:00:59,670
now this time
